bluejetty:00156297:ios.description:
HANDYCUM is a gender tool APP. Focus on the emotional problems of men and women in different places, solve the emotional barriers of both sexes, intelligent APP control, multiple vibration modes, and remote interactive control with friends, giving you a different fun experience!
[Music follow-up] Use the music rhythm to control the vibration intensity;
[Voice Control] Control the strength of the vibration through the volume of the sound;
[Shake] Shake the phone to control the vibration intensity of the hardware;
[Fancy Vibration] You can choose from 9 built-in pattern modes;
[Remote interaction] Even lovers in different places can chat through instant video chat and text;

